Step 1: Open Browser

Open Google Chrome or any browser.

Step 2: Open HubSpot Website

Go to:

HubSpot Official Website

Step 3: Create Free Account
Click Get Started Free
Enter:
Email
Password
Name
Click Create Account
Step 4: Login to HubSpot

After account creation:

Enter email and password
Click Login
Step 5: Open Marketing Section
In dashboard top menu
Click Marketing
Select Planning or Campaigns
Step 6: Create Content Plan

Create the following details in a notebook or Word document.

Example Template
Field	Example
Business Name	Fresh Food Delivery
Target Audience	College students
Goal	Increase website traffic
Content Type	Blog, Instagram posts
Posting Frequency	3 posts per week
Platform	Instagram, Facebook
Keywords	Online food delivery
CTA	Order Now
Step 7: Create Content Calendar

Make a simple table.

Date	Content
Monday	Instagram food post
Wednesday	Blog article
Friday	Offer advertisement
Step 8: Add SEO Keywords

Use keywords like:

Best food delivery
Order food online
Fast delivery service
Step 9: Save the Document
Open MS Word
Type all details
Save as:
ContentMarketingPlan.docx
Step 10: Take Screenshot

Take screenshots of:

HubSpot dashboard
Content plan
Calendar

(Useful for practical exam record)
